---
import Breadcrumbs from '@components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Hero from '@components/Hero.astro';
import header from '@images/header/locate.jpg';
import Layout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { digitalDundeeOrganization } from '@utils/schema';

const meta = {
  title: 'Locate Dundee | Digital Dundee',
  description:
    'Chosen by the Sunday Times as the best place to live in Scotland 2020, Dundee has been recognised as one of the most likely cities to become a leading UK...',
  imageOG: 'generic-social-1200x630.png',
  altOG: 'Locate Dundee',
  schema: digitalDundeeOrganization,
};
---

<Layout metaData={meta}>
  <Hero title="Locate Dundee" image={header} alt="Locate Dundee page header" />
  <div class="wrapper flow">
    <Breadcrumbs />
    <h2>Locate Dundee</h2>
    <p>Chosen by the Sunday Times as the best place to live in Scotland 2020, Dundee has been recognised as one of the most likely cities to become a leading UK tech hub. It offers a high-quality, great value and low-risk investment location.</p>
    <p>Dundee offers not only a fantastic place, but also a true community for businesses to ind ideal space and facilities, grow and prosper,</p>
    <p>We won't just give you a bunch of names and numbers. We are here to have a proper chat and understand your needs. Then we can make suggestions tailored to you, show you round and introduce you to our networks so you can hear for yourself about their experiences of Dundee.</p>
    <p>Dundee is a world class city that offers the perfect place for businesses to grow and prosper. The city offers world-class digital connectivity and fast transport links including direct flights with London.The Invest in Dundee team pro-actively supports investors, developers and businesses to find high quality and cost-effective solutions whether you want to relocate, expand or just have a presence or temporary space in the city.</p>
    <p>The fast-growing city is home to more than 350 businesses employing more than 3,300 people a tech economy worth more than £205 million annually.</p>
    <p>Dundee is an ideal investment location for businesses of all sizes looking to join a collaborative and vibrant creative, digital and technology community. On offer from us is expert advice and support. In Dundee, companies can access leading technology, inspiration and resources for innovation, high quality talent and diverse space.</p>
    <p>So if you are looking for specialist facilities, industrial or office space, or space with potential for development, we are here to help. In Dundee you will find great options for the high quality, cost-effective solutions you need whether you are relocating or growing.</p>
    <h3>TAKE THE NEXT STEP</h3>
    <p>Get in touch directly or go through the Invest in Dundee team and discover what Dundee can offer your business.</p>
    <p>Take a look at our <a href="https://www.dundeecity.gov.uk/property/search.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">property database</a> or find commercial property by searching <a href="http://www.showcase.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SHOWCASE</a>.</p>
    <h3>PRIME SITES</h3>
    <p>Prime sites around Dundee have been developed to offer a focus for creative, digital and technology sectors and research.</p>
    <p>Seabraes near Dundee central Waterfront is a campus style hub for digital media and creative industries with both commercial and residential space. Dundee Technology Park is one of Scotland's premier business parks and is about 15 minutes from Dundee City Centre. Both offer high quality landscaping and prestigious buildings,</p>
    <p>Dundee Technopole is praised as being at the centre of a community of “commercial and research excellence”.<br />(Johnston Carmichael Tech Tracker Report 2019.)</p>
    <p>The Dundee Medipark is adjacent to Ninewells Hospital and within easy reach of Dundee. With companies already located the Technopole and Medipark also offer development options on flexible serviced plots.</p>
    <p>To find out more about and get involved with Dundee’s Life Sciences sector, please go to Bio Dundee.</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.biodundee.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.biodundee.co.uk/</a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
